iOSInjectionProject/

### SwiftPackageManager ###
Packages
# Note: xcuserdata/ is already ignored globally (line 10 - User settings section)
# Note: *.xcodeproj ignores the directory, but we need to track:
# - project.pbxproj (project file)
# - Package.resolved (for Xcode Cloud - use 'git add -f' to add)
# - xcshareddata/xcschemes/*.xcscheme (shared schemes for CI/CD)
# These files should be tracked even though *.xcodeproj is ignored
# *.xcodeproj


